# =============================================================================
# Trivy-Hadolint image - Trivy ignore file
# =============================================================================
#
# CVEs HIGH suprimidos no binário /usr/local/bin/trivy (go binary)
#
# Motivo: estas vulnerabilidades estão nas dependências Go embutidas no próprio
# binário do Trivy (go-billy, go-git, in-toto-golang, stdlib). As versões
# corrigidas (go-git >= 5.19.0, stdlib >= 1.25.10 / 1.26.3) ainda não foram
# incorporadas em nenhuma release oficial do Trivy (última: v0.70.0).
# =============================================================================

# go-billy: path traversal (fixed: 5.9.0) — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-44973

# go-git: improper parsing of crafted objects (fixed: 5.19.0) — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-45022

# stdlib: LookupCNAME buffer overflow via cgo DNS (fixed: 1.25.10 / 1.26.3) — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-33811
# stdlib: HTTP/2 SETTINGS frame infinite loop — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-33814
# stdlib: ParseAddress / ParseAddressList crafted input — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-39820
# stdlib: Dial / LookupPort panic on NUL byte (Windows) — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-39836
# stdlib: DoS via consumePhrase — aguardando release do Trivy
CVE-2026-42499
